{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777875390302","title":"Cross-turn PII exposure requires session-aware masking, not per-turn masking","desc":"PII risk dalam agentic multi-turn muncul ketika fragmen kecil tersebar di banyak turn; proteksi harus mengelola state session dan retroactive pseudonymization.","tags":["permanent-note","privacy","pii","agent","security","memory"],"created":1777875405537,"updated":1777948651877,"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777875390302","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"4138f53186b3456ec210b2ab0822ea60","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777875390302","id":"zettel.1777875390302","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.permanent-note","alias":"permanent-note","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.permanent-note"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777875390302","id":"zettel.1777875390302","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.privacy","alias":"privacy","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.privacy"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777875390302","id":"zettel.1777875390302","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.pii","alias":"pii","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.pii"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777875390302","id":"zettel.1777875390302","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.agent","alias":"agent","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.agent"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777875390302","id":"zettel.1777875390302","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.security","alias":"security","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.security"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777875390302","id":"zettel.1777875390302","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.memory","alias":"memory","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.memory"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777875390302","id":"zettel.1777875390302","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.camp","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":3,"offset":851},"end":{"line":18,"column":49,"offset":897},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.camp"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777875390302","id":"zettel.1777875390302","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":3,"offset":900},"end":{"line":19,"column":44,"offset":941},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture","id":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":284,"offset":3284},"end":{"line":54,"column":308,"offset":3308},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777875390302"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.camp","id":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.camp","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":74,"column":3,"offset":4400},"end":{"line":74,"column":27,"offset":4424},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777875390302"}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"cross-turn-pii-exposure-requires-session-aware-masking-not-per-turn-masking\">Cross-turn PII exposure requires session-aware masking, not per-turn masking<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#cross-turn-pii-exposure-requires-session-aware-masking-not-per-turn-masking\"></a></h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Dalam multi-turn agent, risiko PII bukan hanya dari satu pesan; risiko muncul dari akumulasi fragmen kecil yang bisa digabung menjadi profil identitas.</p>\n<p>Source: <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2604.16521v1\">https://arxiv.org/html/2604.16521v1</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Catatan gue:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Proteksi PII per-turn pada dasarnya stateless. Ia hanya melihat message sekarang dan mengabaikan history yang akan dikirim ulang ke model.</li>\n<li>Cumulative PII Exposure (CPE) membuat unit analisis pindah dari \"message\" ke \"session\".</li>\n<li>Konsekuensinya: jika threshold terlampaui, sistem harus menulis ulang seluruh history dengan pseudonym konsisten sebelum mengirim ke LLM.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Impak:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ini bukan hanya soal deteksi data sensitif, tetapi soal governance atas representasi data sepanjang sesi.</li>\n<li>Bagi security agent, berarti stateful PII registry, co-occurrence graph, dan retroactive masking adalah pola arsitektur yang penting.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Link:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.camp\">CAMP: Cross-Turn PII Protection for LLM Conversations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.pii-agent-architecture\">Arsitektur PII filter dan security agent</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">permanent-note (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">privacy (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">pii (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">agent (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">security (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">memory (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.pii-agent-architecture\">Arsitektur PII filter dan security agent</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.camp\">CAMP: Cross-Turn PII Protection for LLM Conversations</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. 